# Local working files that must never be committed: the live ticket inbox the
# publisher ingests from, the captain's standing-authority record, local
# backups, local agent scratch, a local upstream mirror, and one stray file
# written by a malformed command.
#
# These keep the checkout dirty for bin/fm-merge-local.sh, which refuses to
# fast-forward into a tree that is not clean. Ignoring them is what lets the
# guarded local-merge path land work without moving or deleting a single file.
INBOX/
STANDING-AUTHORITY.md
*.bak-*
.pi/agents/
upstream-pi-subagents-candidate/
/--json
